# Only the landing pages are deployed.
#
# The rest of this repository is the download manager itself: Go sources, the
# built binaries, and the installer payload staged into cmd/odm-installer.
# A static host has no use for any of it, and without this file the CLI
# uploads 91 MB in order to publish 260 KB of HTML.
#
# Allowlist rather than a list of exclusions, so a new directory of binaries
# cannot quietly start being uploaded.
*
!vercel.json
!site
!site/**
